        "body": "Dreaming about a first-class hotel? Welcome to hotel «Conrad Los Angeles» is located in Los Angeles. This hotel is located nearby from the city center. You can take a walk and explore the neighbourhood area of the hotel. Places nearby: The Broad, Civic Center/Grand Park and Ahmanson Theatre."
